# Ash Enterprise: 24 - Strangler

Runtime: **attached node**. `mix ash_enterprise.legacy.setup` creates the legacy schema.

## The legacy table is a resource too

<div class="flex items-center w-full flex-start justify-between rounded-xl p-4" style="background-color: #f0f5f9; color: #61758a;">
